values.content:
Write a press release.

Company: {{ $json.companyName }}
Announcement type: {{ $json.announcementType.replace(/_/g,' ') }}
Dateline: {{ $json.dateline || 'City, State' }}
Release date: {{ $json.releaseDate }}

Key facts (use only these — do not invent additional facts):
{{ $json.keyFacts }}

Key metrics: {{ $json.keyMetrics || 'none provided' }}
Industry context: {{ $json.industryContext || 'not provided' }}
Suggested headline: {{ $json.headline || 'not provided — write one' }}

Quote sources (write quotes attributed to these people/roles, sound natural not corporate):
{{ $json.quotesFrom.map(q=>q.name+' ('+q.title+')'+(q.talking_points?': '+q.talking_points:'')).join('\n') || 'no specific quote sources — use a generic company spokesperson attribution' }}

Company boilerplate: {{ $json.companyBoilerplate || 'not provided — write a brief one from key facts' }}

Return JSON:
{"press_release":{"headline":"newsworthy, specific, not generic","subheadline":"1 sentence supporting the headline with additional context — or null","dateline_and_date":"CITY, State – Month Day, Year –","lead_paragraph":"the single most important fact, who/what/when/where/why in 1-2 sentences","body_paragraphs":["supporting paragraph with details, in descending order of importance"],"quotes":[{"quote":"natural-sounding quote, not corporate jargon","attribution":"Name, Title, Company"}],"boilerplate":"standard About [Company] paragraph","media_contact_block":"formatted contact info block"},"suggested_distribution":["types of outlets or reporters this would suit based on the announcement type"],"headline_alternatives":["2-3 alternative headline options"],"seo_keywords":["keywords this release should be optimized for if posted online"]}
